      "role": "user",
      "content": "endure it? i don't know if i have the strength for that. it just feels like i'm being forced to watch a slow-motion train wreck for the next fifty years. it feels so pointless to keep clinging to a life that's basically just waiting for the end of everything. wouldn't it be more peaceful to just... not have to deal with it?",
